WEBVTT

00:11:27.766 --> 00:11:30.561
He calmly looks at me and he says,

00:11:30.561 --> 00:11:32.354
"I am the storm."

00:11:32.396 --> 00:11:34.356
(Audience murmurs)

00:11:35.733 --> 00:11:38.902
The eyes are always watching us.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:42.740
But how do we use our eyes?

00:11:43.323 --> 00:11:44.450
Do we look?

00:11:45.284 --> 00:11:46.618
Or do we see?

00:11:47.953 --> 00:11:50.164
When you look at this picture,

00:11:50.205 --> 00:11:54.293
you might find yourself thinking
about the politics of war.

00:11:54.877 --> 00:11:57.796
But when you see
the person in this picture,

00:11:57.838 --> 00:11:59.506
you get to know Jessica.